strings.collections.special_event_steps.miyama_0:
This was the first time she really said:

I am not a surgery patient.

But at this time:

- The voice is very soft;
- Sentences are choppy;
- She has shown marked post-sedation drowsiness;
- Everyone has just experienced the pre-event of "the patient ran away because of fear".

So the staff misread this sentence as:

High tension + slurred gibbering after sedation.

The student nurse acts very seriously.

Ayako can only feel it intermittently:

- The skin of the lower abdomen is flattened;
- The cold touch feels close to you;
- Fine hair is cleaned up bit by bit;
- Occasionally, someone would gently press her thigh with the palm of her hand to stop her from moving because of itchiness.

In view is:

- Huge shadowless lamp;
- Surgical cap;
- masks;
- Turquoise surgical gown;
- gloved hands reaching in from one's sides.

Ayako opened her eyes drowsily.

The shadowless lamp is still dazzling.

She couldn't see her belly.

But you can see:

- Head down in the mountains;
- Sakaguchi also lowered his head;
- Miyuki kept passing the equipment over;
- Everyone's eyes are focused on the center of their abdomen.

She left the OR directly and went to the nurse's station to check:

- Original schedule;
- time;
- Outpatient/visitor records;
- holding bay records.

Three people entered.

Ayako has woken up very energetic.

Next to the bed lies:

- sketchbook;
- Pencil;
- A copy of the official surgical field photograph of your own abdominal cavity.
